## Environment Variables

```env
# AI
AI_PROVIDER=deepseek                    # deepseek | openai
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Voice
VOICE_PROVIDER=google                   # google | yandex | openai
GOOGLE_TTS_KEY=

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/rentai

# Auth
JWT_SECRET=
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES_IN=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# Storage
STORAGE_PROVIDER=local                  # local | s3
STORAGE_LOCAL_PATH=./uploads
# S3_BUCKET=
# S3_REGION=
# S3_ACCESS_KEY=
# S3_SECRET_KEY=

# Feature Flags
FF_VOICE_ENABLED=false
FF_REALTIME_CALLS_ENABLED=false

# App
NODE_ENV=development
API_URL=http://localhost:3010
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3010
NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=ws://localhost:3010
```

- Never commit `.env` files; document every variable in `.env.example`
- Validate all required env variables at startup via Zod schema in ConfigModule

